t be grateful?","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"36:36","t":"Exalted is He who created all pairs - from what the earth grows and from themselves and from that which they do not know.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"36:37","t":"And a sign for them is the night. We remove from it the [light of] day, so they are [left] in darkness.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"36:38","t":"And the sun runs [on course] toward its stopping point. That is the determination of the Exalted in Might, the Knowing.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"36:39","t":"And the moon - We have determined for it phases, until it returns [appearing] like the old date stalk.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"36:40","t":"It is not allowable [i.e., possible] for the sun to reach the moon, nor does the night overtake the day, but each, in an orbit, is swimming.","j":23,"h":45,"s":36,"a":40,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":45,"surahs":[36],"sajdah":false}